        null
    ],
    "optionsVersion": 1,
    "apiVersion": "VERSION_0",
    "isResourceIntensiveScript": false,
    "showPartitioning": false,
    "icon": "data:image/png;base64,",
    "description": "Word and phrase counts in a text field, overall and per group, with stop words, n-grams and the terms most distinctive of each group.",
    "category": "Analytics",
    "subcategory": "Text",
    "tags": [
        "text analytics",
        "word frequency",
        "n-grams",
        "word cloud",
        "survey comments",
        "voice of the customer",
        "log-odds",
        "keywords",
        "visokio-agents"
    ],
    "introductoryText": "Counts the words and short phrases in a text field (survey comments, complaints, reviews, ticket descriptions, call notes), overall and per group, and finds the words most **distinctive** of each group.\n\n- Words are lower-cased; English **stop words** (the, and, was...) are removed, plus any you add; numbers are dropped unless you keep them\n- **Phrases** of up to 4 consecutive remaining words (for example *call back*, *wait on hold*)\n- For each term: occurrences, the **number of rows using it** and the share of rows, and its rank\n- With **groups** (channel, product, NPS category): the share of rows in the other groups and a **distinctiveness z-score** (weighted log-odds with an informative prior, Monroe et al. 2008); z above 1.96 is flagged\n\nA second output returns the rows with their word count, the number of terms kept and which of the top terms they use, so comments can be filtered by term in a Report.",
    "dependencies": "",
